<title>UK: Austria sets 2.0 bln schilling medium term bills.</title>
<headline>Austria sets 2.0 bln schilling medium term bills.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria has issued 2.0 billion Austrian schillings of medium term bills, lead manager RZB-Austria said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Due January 30, 2000, the deal pays a 4 1/16 percent coupon an has an issue price of par.</p>
<p>Payment date is January 30, 1997. Fees are undisclosed. The paper is listed in Vienna and governed by Austrian law.</p>
<p>The deal has been fully placed with institutional investors, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
